Install useful companion tools for the Arch Linux package manager

Commands:
- checkupdates: safely list pending package updates
- paccache: clean old packages from the package cache
- pacdiff: review and merge .pacnew and .pacsave files
- paclist: list installed packages from a repository
- paclog-pkglist: list packages recorded in pacman.log
- pacscripts: show package install scripts
- pacsearch: search packages with formatted output
- pacsort: sort package names and versions
- pactree: show package dependency trees
- rankmirrors: rank mirrors by performance
- updpkgsums: update checksums in a PKGBUILD

Source: https://gitlab.archlinux.org/pacman/pacman-contrib
